                <pb facs="0101" n="5" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg5"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Buchanan to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Buenos Ayres</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-11-16"><hi rendition="#italic">November 16,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Hawaiian schooner <hi rendition="#italic">Americana</hi>, carrying the flag of
                    Hawaii, has arrived from St. John, where was cleared by consul of the Hawaiian
                    Islands. That Government was never represented here. Captain has applied the
                    United States consul. Will you please send telegraph instructions for his
                    guidance.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buchanan.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
